# SEO

- Canonical site URL is `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` via `src/lib/seo/site.ts`. No trailing slash.
- `robots.ts` allows `/` and disallows `/studio`, `/login`, `/denied`, `/auth`. Point sitemap at `${SITE_URL}/sitemap.xml`.
- `sitemap.ts` includes static public paths plus published articles, notes, tags, and projects. Never list drafts or studio routes.
- RSS is `/feed.xml` (latest published articles + notes). Escape XML. Keep `alternates` on root metadata.
- JSON-LD helpers live in `src/components/seo/json-ld.tsx` (`Person`, `WebSite`, `BlogPosting`). Escape `<` in JSON.
- OG images: `src/components/seo/og-image.tsx` plus per-route `opengraph-image.tsx` under articles/notes. Stay 1200×630.
- Studio routes set `robots: { index: false, follow: false }`.
- After new public routes or post kinds, update sitemap, robots (if needed), and JSON-LD in the same change.

Audit workflow: `seo` skill.
